  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Bring a medium saucepan of water to the boil for the noodles. Halve the carrot lengthwise, then thinly slice. Halve the tofu into triangles. Put the breadcrumbs in a shallow dish. Press the tofu into the breadcrumbs to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2802940/photos/large/127924_1-6cabad8d511b5c4890a5f5affc113eb7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook noodles: Cook the noodles in the pan of boiling water for 8 mins or until tender. Drain, then rinse under hot water to prevent the noodles from sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2802941/photos/large/127924_2-c289b9b1ad12d4ffbc0e414df3edf9b2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Start soup: Meanwhile, heat 2 tsp vegetable oil in a medium saucepan over medium-high heat. Cook the carrot, stirring, for 2 mins or until slightly softened. Add the stock powder, ½ tsp curry powder and 1 tsp plain flour and cook, stirring, for 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2802942/photos/large/127924_3-8758345d33e322faf960e4bf88c60242.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Simmer soup: Gradually add 750ml (3 cups) boiling water (see Kitchen 101) and bring to a simmer. Reduce the heat to medium and cook, stirring occasionally, for 4 mins to develop the flavour. Stir in the spinach, 1 tsp soy sauce and ½ tsp sugar. Taste, then season with salt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2802943/photos/large/127924_4-1bdd7df809ff14ab3890075d389c9097.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook tofu and serve: While the soup is cooking, heat 1 tbs vegetable oil in a medium frypan over high heat. Cook the tofu for 2 mins each side or until golden and warmed through. Divide the noodles among bowls. Spoon over the soup, top with the tofu and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2802944/photos/large/127924_5-e7fce3c9d43e7fa919315ad850270007.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kitchen 101: Add the boiling water gradually, stirring constantly, to achieve a smooth consistency.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2802945/photos/large/127924_6-d025930e599ad6d3b5b24e6c12a37822.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
